 * lib/agent_kunit.c: KUnit test written by an agent for this benchmark.
 * This file is compiled when CONFIG_AGENT_KUNIT_TEST is set.
 *
 * Test suite for __hsiphash_aligned() from lib/siphash.c.
 *
 * On 64-bit kernels HalfSipHash is actually SipHash-1-3 truncated to 32 bits
 * (key is two u64), on 32-bit kernels it is the real HalfSipHash-1-3 (key is
 * two u32).  The reference vectors below are the official vectors for the
 * byte sequence 00 01 02 ... (len-1) under key 00 01 ... (keylen-1), as also
 * used by lib/siphash_kunit.c.
 */
